7_logokucom_vs.jpg.webp" alt="Logo Sv Logo Vs" class="logo absolute z-10 w-[28%]"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/mock/btl-lk.png" alt="Bottle Mockup" class="mockup-img absolute inset-0 z-20 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-30"><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-black text-white text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">ID: LK0024208</span></div></div></div><div class="md:col-span-5 md:mt-32 group relative mockup cap"><div class="aspect-square bg-gray-50 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/data/items/1715756457_logokucom_vs.jpg.webp" alt="Logo Sv Logo Vs" class="logo absolute z-10 w-[40%]"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/mock/cap-lk3.png" alt="Cap Mockup" class="mockup-img absolute inset-0 z-20 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="md:col-span-5 group relative mockup instagram"><div class="aspect-square bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/data/items/1715756457_logokucom_vs.jpg.webp" alt="Logo Sv Logo Vs" class="logo-avatar absolute z-10 w-[40%]"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/data/items/1715756457_logokucom_vs.jpg.webp" alt="Logo Sv Logo Vs" class="logo absolute z-10 w-[40%]"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/mock/ig-lk.png" alt="IG Mockup" class="mockup-img absolute inset-0 z-20 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="md:col-span-7 group relative mockup namecard grayscale"><div class="aspect-[16/10] flex items-center justify-center"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/mock/name-card-lk.png" alt="Card Mockup" class="mockup-img absolute inset-0 z-20 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/data/items/1715756457_logokucom_vs.jpg.webp" alt="Logo Sv Logo Vs" class="logo absolute z-10 w-[40%]"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 lg:py-20 border-b border-gray-100"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12"><div class="space-y-6"><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="divide-y divide-gray-100"><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">What is Ready-Made Logo?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Ready-made logo is a pre-designed logo that can be used immediately, or with adjustments if needed.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">How Long Does It Take to Get a Logo After Purchase?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">You will receive the logo file shortly after purchase, especially if there are no specific adjustments or requests. You can download it from your account directly.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Can I Change the Logo After Purchase?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Yes, you can change the logo you purchased as needed.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">How Can I Request a Refund If I'm Not Satisfied with the Purchased Logo?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">We provide a full money-back guarantee if you are not satisfied with your purchase. Please refer to our <a class="text-danger" href="return-policy">Return Policy</a>.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Will the Logo I Purchased Be Removed from the Site After Purchase?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">No, the logo you purchased will not be removed from our site. However, the logo will no longer be available for sale to others after you purchase it. Logos that are not removed can be strong evidence for legal action if similar logos appear later on.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">What Payment Methods Are Available?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">We accept payments via Paypal, debit cards, credit cards, bank transfers, and other online payment methods.</p></details><details class="py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Is My Payment Secure?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Yes, we use a secure payment system to ensure the security of your payment.</p></details></div></div><div class=""><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-6">About Designer</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between"><div id="designer" class="flex items-start gap-4 scroll-mt-32"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/image/data/store/600_1715644053_fg.png" alt="ERS_ART" class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full grayscale flex-shrink-0"><div class="space-y-1"><a href="https://www.logoku.com/ers_art" class="font-semibold text-sm"> ERS_ART</a><div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 hidden">Indonesia • Member since 14 May 2024</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3 max-w-md leading-relaxed">As a freelance brand identity designer based in bandung, theindonesia, I am dedicated to creating meaningful and timeless brands for my clients. With over a decade of experience in logo design and storytelling, I am passionate about delivering high-quality results that meet the unique needs of each project</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-100 py-20"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><h3 class="serif text-3xl mb-12">More from <span class="italic font-light">ERS_ART</span></h3><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div><div class="relative group bg-gray-50 p-4"><a href="logo-p-ceahd" class="block flex items-center justify-center"><img src="https://www.logoku.com/logoku-icon.svg" data-src="https://www.logoku.com/image/c/data/items/1715644881_logokucom_w.jpg" alt="Logo P" class="w-full h-